# Keep the build context small and reproducible.
.git
.github
**/node_modules
# The console is built fresh in the image's compile-mode Node stage; never copy a
# local build (it would make images non-reproducible / depend on working-tree
# state). Unused by the prebuilt path, which ships GoReleaser's UI-embedded binary.
internal/management/ui/dist
*.db
*.db-wal
*.db-shm
.env*
/turnstile
/tmp
tmp/
build-errors.log
# NOTE: /dist is intentionally NOT ignored — the prebuilt Docker build
# (BIN_MODE=prebuilt, used by CI) COPYs GoReleaser's binaries from there.
